\details{
The gamlss parameters map to DEGPD parameters as follows:
\code{mu} = sigma (GPD scale), \code{sigma} = xi (GPD shape),
\code{nu} = delta (G-transformation).

The scores used by \code{gamlss()} are analytic and numerically
